<title>ESTONIA: TABLE-ESTONIA JULY CPI 0.3 PCT MO/MO, YR/YR 10.8.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ESTONIA JULY CPI 0.3 PCT MO/MO, YR/YR 10.8.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian consumer prices rose by a monthly 0.3 percent in July for a year-on-year inflation rate of 10.8 percent, the statistics department said on Thursday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN CPI			 July '97   June '97  July '96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)     +0.3	+0.7	 +0.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)	+10.8     +10.8	+23.0</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
